    tolerance, layers, scenarios, data``; ``schema`` is
    ``climate-grid/cmc-v1``, ``reference`` is the first item's name and
    ``names`` lists the remaining item names in item order.  The
    tolerance, layers and scenarios axes echo the first matrix.  ``data``
    is ordered by item name (the remaining items in order) and then
    scenario; each row uses the key order ``name, scenario, count,
    states, interval, from, to, rank``.  ``count``, the ``states``
    differences and ``rank`` are ints and every output float is
    ``round(x, 12)`` with negative zero normalized to ``0.0``.  The
    input is not modified.

